VALUES ('MCD','owner_summary','editorial_analysis','MCDONALDS Corp. earns owner value through franchise rent and royalties, company-operated restaurant sales, initial fees, and technology-related economics. The three questions that matter most are guest counts, average check, value, menu mix, and geography, cash flow, rent, royalties, remodel cost, labor, and operator returns, openings, closures, build cost, payback, digital, and capacity.','Defines the central ownership lens and its falsifiable operating variables.','MCD SEC filing library','https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0000063908&owner=exclude','MCDONALDS CORP filings provide the audited financial record, business description, material risks, commitments, governance, and current reports.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
