VALUES ('MCD','bear_case','editorial_analysis','Traffic and affordability can weaken the owner outcome; monitor guest counts, value scores, promotions, and lower-income behavior. Franchisee alignment can weaken the owner outcome; monitor operator cash flow, debt, remodel commitments, disputes, and closures. Labor and regulation can weaken the owner outcome; monitor wages, scheduling, joint-employer rules, food safety, and litigation. A valuation that assumes flawless execution can fall even when the underlying business remains viable.','Preserves the skeptical interpretation as a sourced, reviewable claim.','MCD SEC filing library','https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0000063908&owner=exclude','MCDONALDS CORP filings provide the audited financial record, business description, material risks, commitments, governance, and current reports.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
