VALUES ('MCHP','thesis_breaker','editorial_analysis','The owner thesis breaks if MICROCHIP TECHNOLOGY INC cannot defend its position in microcontrollers, analog, connectivity, timing, FPGA, power, security, and embedded-control semiconductors and repeatedly fails to convert reported growth into resilient per-share free cash flow after required investment, balance-sheet obligations, and dilution.','Defines evidence that would invalidate the ownership thesis.','MCHP SEC filing library','https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0000827054&owner=exclude','The issuer record provides MICROCHIP TECHNOLOGY INC''s filing history, including annual, quarterly, current, proxy, ownership, and registration disclosures.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
