VALUES ('PHM','bear_case','editorial_analysis','Demand for homebuilding, land development, mortgage, title, insurance, entry-level and move-up communities, and active-adult housing can slow, shift, or become less profitable even when the broader market continues to grow. Recession, fashion, value perception, or weaker experiences can reduce traffic and price. Low switching costs, promotion, or disintermediation can pressure margins. Accounting earnings can overstate owner economics when working capital, capital spending, acquisitions, stock compensation, debt, leases, or dilution absorb cash.','Preserves the skeptical interpretation as a sourced, reviewable claim.','PHM SEC filing library','https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0000822416&owner=exclude','The issuer record provides PULTEGROUP INC''s filing history, including annual, quarterly, current, proxy, ownership, and registration disclosures.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
