VALUES ('PLD','bear_case','editorial_analysis','Industrial supply and demand can weaken the owner outcome; monitor vacancy, starts, absorption, rents, and customer failures. Capital markets can weaken the owner outcome; monitor rates, cap rates, debt, equity, private-fund flows, and disposition values. Development and power can weaken the owner outcome; monitor cost, entitlement, leasing, power access, stabilization, and returns. A valuation that assumes flawless execution can fall even when the underlying business remains viable.','Preserves the skeptical interpretation as a sourced, reviewable claim.','PLD SEC filing library','https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0001045609&owner=exclude','Prologis, Inc. filings provide the audited financial record, business description, material risks, commitments, governance, and current reports.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
