VALUES ('PPL','bear_case','editorial_analysis','Demand for regulated electric and gas utilities, transmission and distribution, grid modernization, reliability, and customer energy delivery can slow, shift, or become less profitable even when the broader market continues to grow. Bills, politics, and customer pressure can delay or reduce recovery. Large generation, grid, and environmental projects can face delays or cost overruns. Accounting earnings can overstate owner economics when working capital, capital spending, acquisitions, stock compensation, debt, leases, or dilution absorb cash.','Preserves the skeptical interpretation as a sourced, reviewable claim.','PPL SEC filing library','https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0000922224&owner=exclude','The issuer record provides PPL CORP''s filing history, including annual, quarterly, current, proxy, ownership, and registration disclosures.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
